; A bucket account completes only a transaction with exactly one posting
; (xact_base_t::finalize: "posts.size() == 1"), and bracket-virtual
; postings count.  One real posting beside a balanced bracket pair is
; therefore not completed, and its residual is rejected.  Since #3317
; the diagnostic names the group whose remainder does not balance.

bucket Assets:Cash

2024/01/01 Real posting with a balanced bracket pair
    Expenses:Food     $10
    [Budget:Food]    $-10
    [Budget:Cash]     $10

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 12:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 9-12:
> 2024/01/01 Real posting with a balanced bracket pair
>     Expenses:Food     $10
>     [Budget:Food]    $-10
>     [Budget:Cash]     $10
Unbalanced remainder of real postings is:
                 $10
Amount to balance against:
                 $10
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
